                <pb facs="0904" n="784" sameAs="frus:frus1931v02/pg784"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.48 Earthquake of 1931/16: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Lay</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-04-01T11:00:00-06:00">April 1, 1931—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 1:55 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>56. Have sent Naval Attaché Geyer to Managua this morning to assist relief work
                    by Tela Railroad Company plane which is carrying repairs for radio station
                    there.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lay</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
